{"id":"658799","name":"青椒萝卜干炒鸡蛋","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658799/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青椒","amount":"120g"},{"name":"萝卜干","amount":"150g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"3瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备所有的食材，萝卜干用水泡淡咸味。","img":"images/658799/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋加少许盐调散。","img":"images/658799/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"青椒去籽。","img":"images/658799/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用刀拍扁。","img":"images/658799/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切碎。","img":"images/658799/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"萝卜干和蒜末也切碎，食材准备就绪。","img":"images/658799/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"起锅烧油，炒香蒜末。","img":"images/658799/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入萝卜干。","img":"images/658799/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"炒至干香。","img":"images/658799/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入青椒，炒至表面起酥皮。","img":"images/658799/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入鸡蛋液。","img":"images/658799/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"定定型。","img":"images/658799/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"最后淋入酱油翻拌入味即可。","img":"images/658799/step_13.jpeg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658799/step_14.jpeg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}